    <briefdescription>
<para>Internal implementation detail class that provides out-of-line storage for extra info used by the machine instruction when this info cannot be stored in-line within the instruction itself. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This has to be defined eagerly due to the implementation constraints of <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_pointer_sum_type" kindref="compound">PointerSumType</ref></computeroutput> where it is used. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
